            "review_title": "Review at Nhoàn Cafe & Vegetarian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "MLouise M\n17 contributions\n0\nGem in the burbs\nJan 2025 • Solo\nThis is a real surprise about 40 minutes north west of Saigon city centre. There is construction a few km away and the landscape near here is not so exciting but once the driver ended up down a narrow lane, the wee area opened up like an oasis as there is a pizza place next door and cafe Nhoan offers fine wine, gourmet vegetarian (ahhh heaven… no sneaky pork), gourmet ice cream and all sorts of coffee and other drinks at a very reasonable price. I highly recommend this beautiful restaurant. It takes a little while to get out here from district one but wow! Real bang for your buck and such a lovely atmosphere. Please come. You won’t regret it. Their English is superb btw.\nRead more\nWritten January 5, 2025\nNhoàn Vegetarian Restaurant\nThank you for voting us!\nWritten November 6, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
